      "uid": "zhcn:3675c48b06556bd677cd06a1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "因为我们从来没有一起在比赛里奔跑过……\r\n我明明那么期待……",
      "source_fingerprint": "cb370735a0412e4f3d869e29353a1607aa505571edaaa06f195287ebffa5cc6e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
