    {
      "uid": "zhcn:76666179cfa79d7fb72caef7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……我之前也曾迷惘过。\r\n在我无法随心所欲地奔跑的时候、无法达到自己期望的时候……",
      "source_fingerprint": "526c8c455ea9e1aafcc7ca4a964d959765c5c071922d3abb74c4b0cf2fd6cef5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/02/0006/storytimeline_020006191.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        21,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/21/text"
    },
    {
