    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d9a52f9ff69dea7fce3fdccc",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "『虽然这话不是训练员该说的话，\r\n但是忘却胜负、随心所欲的奔跑吧』……\r\n就是这番话救赎了那时的我，如今我依然记忆犹新。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e78f57c0df2cca2c616ebb5d57ae1d76f9d6f332c8ca3ff0ec7a085242adc453",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
